    preface: ["See what your 2025 gifts made possible."], 
    video:"",
    body: ["Because of you, DAC enters the new year stronger and ready to keep fighting for families.","This work is not easy. Parents walk into court carrying fear, grief, and the weight of being judged before anyone has heard their story. Your support makes it possible for our attorneys, social workers, and mentor parents to stand beside them with the compassion, skill, and lived experience they deserve.","Together, we raised funds to:","✔ Make sure parents have a full defense team from day one","✔ Keep children safely with their families whenever possible","✔ Provide mentor parent support grounded in lived experience","✔ Train service providers and community partners through Know Your Rights education","✔ Challenge harmful decisions and practices that separate families unnecessarily","Your support made all of this possible. You helped parents feel heard. You helped children stay connected to their families. You helped us push back against a system that is often overwhelming and unjust.","Thank you for standing with us and for believing in this work.","With gratitude,The DAC Team"],
